"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"燕丹","kind":"person","person_id":"e3o_2bk_lhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"e3o_2bk_lhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"衛先生","kind":"person","person_id":"m0s_giw_1h6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"兩主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或譬喻保留；燕尾生不直接當作另一具名人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或譬喻保留；燕尾生不直接當作另一具名人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0114","start":114,"end":117,"surface":"衛先生","kind":"person","person_id":"m0s_giw_1h6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m016-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p017","text":"昔卞和獻寶，楚王刖之；李斯竭忠，胡亥極刑。是以箕子詳狂，接輿辟世，恐遭此患也。願大王孰察卞和、李斯之意，而後楚王、胡亥之聽，無使臣為箕子、接輿所笑。臣聞比干剖心，子胥鴟夷，臣始不信，乃今知之。願大王孰察，少加憐焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"卞和","kind":"person","person_id":"9j0_saz_b8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"y9v_xi8_8n3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"49g_7az_e4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"胡亥","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"8a9_tj8_6i7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"接輿","kind":"person","person_id":"8f4_qc5_g5e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"卞和","kind":"person","person_id":"9j0_saz_b8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"49g_7az_e4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"y9v_xi8_8n3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"胡亥","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"8a9_tj8_6i7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"接輿","kind":"person","person_id":"8f4_qc5_g5e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"比干","kind":"person","person_id":"xtq_oi8_w82","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"g9h_5ih_ug1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p022","text":"臣聞明月之珠，夜光之璧，以闇投人於道路，人無不按劍相眄者。何則？無因而至前也。蟠木根柢，輪囷離詭，而為萬乘器者。何則？以左右先為之容也。故無因至前，雖出隨侯之珠，夜光之璧，猶結怨而不見德。故有人先談，則以枯木朽株樹功而不忘。今夫天下布衣窮居之士，身在貧賤，雖蒙堯、舜之術，挾伊、管之辯，懷龍逢、比干之意，欲盡忠當世之君，而素無根柢之容，雖竭精思，欲開忠信，輔人主之治，則人主必有按劍相眄之跡，是使布衣不得為枯木朽株之資也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0116","start":116,"end":122,"surface":"布衣窮居之士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0130","start":130,"end":131,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"vz2_xlj_noq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"aal_nze_fai","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"伊","kind":"person","person_id":"qqj_r6h_knh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"管","kind":"person","person_id":"chm_jfj_3y8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"龍逢","kind":"person","person_id":"bnl_xoy_8z2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"比干","kind":"person","person_id":"xtq_oi8_w82","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0155","start":155,"end":159,"surface":"當世之君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0179","start":179,"end":181,"surface":"人主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m022-0185","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"人主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p025","text":"臣聞盛飾入朝者不以利汙義，砥厲名號者不以欲傷行，故縣名勝母而曾子不入，邑號朝歌而墨子回車。今欲使天下寥廓之士，攝於威重之權，主於位勢之貴，故回面汙行以事諂諛之人而求親近於左右，則士伏死堀穴巖巖之中耳，安肯有盡忠信而趨闕下者哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m025-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m025-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"曾子","kind":"person","person_id":"ov9_hou_2hp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m025-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"墨子","kind":"person","person_id":"06s_zyx_maw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m025-0076","start":76,"end":80,"surface":"諂諛之人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m025-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p026","text":"書奏梁孝王，孝王使人出之，卒為上客。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m026-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m026-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m026-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"使人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m026-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p027","text":"太史公曰：魯連其指意雖不合大義，然余多其在布衣之位，蕩然肆志，不詘於諸侯，談說於當世，折卿相之權。鄒陽辭雖不遜，然其比物連類，有足悲者，亦可謂抗直不橈矣，吾是以附之列傳焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"hh3_ak4_jge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"p7k_2z7_84m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"卿相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代保留，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m027-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"鄒陽","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p001","text":"司馬相如者，蜀郡成都人也，字長卿。少時好讀書，學擊劍，故其親名之曰犬子。相如既學，慕藺相如之為人，更名相如。以貲為郎，事孝景帝，為武騎常侍，非其好也。會景帝不好辭賦，是時梁孝王來朝，從遊說之士齊人鄒陽、淮陰枚乘、吳莊忌夫子之徒，相如見而說之，因病免，客游梁。梁孝王令與諸生同舍，相如得與諸生游士居數歲，乃著子虛之賦。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"司馬相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"長卿","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"犬子","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"藺相如","kind":"person","person_id":"sfa_wwl_tt2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"孝景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"鄒陽","kind":"person","person_id":"06n_ttw_xgt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"枚乘","kind":"person","person_id":"e1m_xt0_8w7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"莊忌","kind":"person","person_id":"g8d_9kf_uqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m001-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","book_id":"b-shiji-117","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-058","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang","source":{"title":"史記／卷058","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷058","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷058&oldid=8735555","revision_id":8735555,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"22段篇文、4段褚先生附述及1段索隱述贊；現代欄題不當古文。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"取得時HTML與固定修訂一致，只去外緣空白；保留筑、然后、壹湌、適孫、齊如、應縣、削厲、霸昌廄、闚與旌旂等見證原字。末段依其前索隱述贊欄題分層，不補標籤入正文。","note":"全27段已核讀並作明示人物首輪；未核底本、影像或現代研究。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-083","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou","source":{"title":"史記／卷083","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷083","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷083&oldid=2089252","revision_id":2089252,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"27段正文，自魯仲連者至太史公論贊；排除人